{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/5b973116f4eac863e6fb909cfaa5b8da.poster.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/5b973116f4eac863e6fb909cfaa5b8da.webm?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/5b973116f4eac863e6fb909cfaa5b8da.mp4?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/57c99ae3e320525eb494ccaa4d28d7c3.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1119 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/e35648d39120960fce8855d8fa217f15.poster.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/e35648d39120960fce8855d8fa217f15.webm?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/e35648d39120960fce8855d8fa217f15.mp4?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cockpit and face the ultimate aerial challenge. Engage in massive one-on-one battles against city-crushing Kaiju. Every fight is a pulse-pounding test of skill, reflex, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/1ca10a425f6739ba993d62887706ab6c.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1119 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/b69aef2134752d76fe0b422564c0adf9.poster.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/b69aef2134752d76fe0b422564c0adf9.webm?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/b69aef2134752d76fe0b422564c0adf9.mp4?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a barrage of powerful weapons against relentless foes. Dodge deadly attacks and fight to stay alive in the chaos. Grow stronger with every battle as your skills and arsenal improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/0a84492af133c954648494cfa0467363.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1119 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/84c0934bbb69da3fed65c9307596c038.poster.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/84c0934bbb69da3fed65c9307596c038.webm?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/84c0934bbb69da3fed65c9307596c038.mp4?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter towering Kaiju, each with its own devastating abilities. No two beasts behave the same, forcing you to adapt on the fly. Master their patterns or risk being torn from the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/0cdd31acb0b60650b94f2093ae60ee35.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1119 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/b48e7749aac87944580cc21b55331400.poster.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/b48e7749aac87944580cc21b55331400.webm?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/b48e7749aac87944580cc21b55331400.mp4?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your jet with a variety of weapons, gadgets, and upgrades. Experiment with different builds to find the perfect combat style. Forge a machine capable of taking down the most fearsome Kaiju.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/295be4ed779a80583fbdf6e685c4d77a.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1119 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/a07941635622d35bd658d30ced6430ae.poster.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/a07941635622d35bd658d30ced6430ae.webm?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/a07941635622d35bd658d30ced6430ae.mp4?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unpredictable, full of intense challenges and surprises. Fail, adapt, and return stronger in your next attempt. Roguelite progression ensures every encounter tests your strategy and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/fcd7ad05249c48607827bc05cf5f61fc.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1119 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/bcdbd43605aa9a4bffd95b1a7bb5233e.poster.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/bcdbd43605aa9a4bffd95b1a7bb5233e.webm?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/bcdbd43605aa9a4bffd95b1a7bb5233e.mp4?t=1759377296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end\u2014it is a lesson and an opportunity to evolve. Each defeat enhances your jet and unlocks new abilities for the next run. Embrace failure to become the ultimate Kaiju slayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/b85e9dd373dc8888096b5609770e7a65.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1119 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/30b588fe03a20bb945f920ea121624ed.poster.avif?t=1759377296\" width=1170 he